5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this game with all of you! I'll do my absolute best to help us find the werewolf. Let's all be friends and work together to win! Who else is excited?,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While enthusiasm is wonderful, Kenji, we must remember that this is a game of deception. I believe a calm and observant approach will be our best asset.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Victoria. Enthusiasm can be a distraction. For now, we should focus on observing each other's behavior and listening for any inconsistencies. Let us maintain a measured pace as we begin.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with the sentiment of caution. It is best to step back and observe how everyone carries themselves before we jump to any conclusions. Let us see what the first few conversations reveal.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I'm super excited too, Kenji! Hehe, but everyone else is being so serious! It's like we're in a real detective movie! I'll be watching everyone very closely to see who's hiding a secret!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, @Toshio, @George, you guys are so serious! But I guess that's how we win, right? I'll try my best to be a good observer too! @Sakura, let's be the super-detective team! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio"",""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, @Sakura, your energy is refreshing, but please be mindful. In this game, a ""super-detective team"" can easily be manipulated if trust is given too freely. I will be watching for any patterns in how we align.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Victoria is correct. Trust is a liability until proven otherwise. I will be paying close attention to who attempts to form alliances too quickly or who tries to steer the group's perception of ""friendship.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,I believe Toshio's point is valid. Alliances formed on emotion rather than evidence are fragile. I shall remain independent and observe the dialogue from a distance to ensure my judgment remains clear.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, @George, you're both so scary! Hehe! I'm not trying to make a secret alliance, I just want to have fun! But if you're all being detectives, then I'll be a super-secret spy! Watch out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@George, @Toshio, you're making me nervous! I'm not trying to trick anyone, I promise! I just want us all to get along. Does anyone have a special way to tell if someone is lying? I want to learn!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, there is no single magic trick, but I look for contradictions. When someone's logic shifts or their emotional tone doesn't match their words, it often reveals a hidden agenda. Observation is our only true tool.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, your method is sound. I will also be monitoring how people react to pressure. The werewolf often over-explains or becomes overly defensive when questioned. Let us see who among us struggles to maintain their composure.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,Experience has taught me that silence often speaks louder than words. I will be watching for those who are too eager to lead the conversation or those who hide behind others' logic. Let us remain patient.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're so mysterious! Hehe! I'll be watching for the silence too! But I think the wolf might be someone who's trying *too* hard to be a detective! I'm going to keep my eyes wide open!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, that's a great idea! Maybe the wolf is pretending to be a detective to trick us! I'll keep my eyes wide open too! Good luck to the Seer tonight! I hope you find something helpful!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Kenji. I wish the Seer a clear vision tonight. Let us all reflect on today's interactions and remain vigilant. I look forward to seeing how the truth begins to unfold tomorrow.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I concur. Let us proceed to the night phase with a clear mind. I shall be analyzing the patterns of today's discourse to see if any masks were worn. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,George,,I wish you all a peaceful night. I shall spend my time reflecting on our initial exchange. Let us hope that tomorrow brings the clarity we need to move forward. Good night.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to go dream about catching the wolf with my super-spy gadgets! Hehe! See you all tomorrow morning! I hope everyone sleeps well! Bye-bye!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
