69,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Oh no! Toshio is gone, and Victoria got attacked too! This is so scary! I feel really bad that we voted for Toshio if he was a good guy. Does this mean the werewolf is still here? @everyone, what happened?!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a tragedy that we lost Toshio, and Victoria's attack is a grave concern. The fact that Victoria was targeted suggests the werewolf is attempting to eliminate those who prioritize logic. We must remain calm and analyze this.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, Victoria too?! That's so spooky! Hehe, but wait... if the wolf attacked Victoria, then she was definitely a good guy! Poor Toshio and Victoria! Now it's just us three! Who's the real wolf?!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@George, @Sakura, you're right, it's just us now! I'm so scared! If Victoria was a good guy, then the wolf is either you or Sakura! But I don't want to be wrong again! @George, you're so calm, is that a clue?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,George,,"@Kenji, composure is not a clue, but a necessity in a crisis. If I were the wolf, would I not have tried to divert the vote away from Toshio yesterday? My calmness is simply my way of processing this tragedy.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, you're so funny! But @George is right, he didn't try to save Toshio! Hehe, but wait... if George is so calm, maybe he's just a pro at this game? Or maybe he's the wolf pretending to be a fancy gentleman! What do you think, @George?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""George"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@George, you're so fancy! But @Sakura is right, it's kind of spooky how you're not scared at all! If you're the wolf, you're really good at acting! @Sakura, do you think he's lying to us? I'm so confused!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,George,,"@Kenji, @Sakura, it is easy to mistake a steady hand for a mask. I am simply relying on my experience to keep us from panicking. If we let fear dictate our choice, the wolf has already won.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're always talking about masks and experience! Hehe! It's like you're a character in a mystery book! @Kenji, don't you think it's a bit too perfect? A real human would be at least a little bit scared!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@George, you're right that we shouldn't panic, but @Sakura makes a good point! Everyone else was so scared, but you're just... steady. It's a bit weird! Are you the wolf, or just really brave? I really hope you're a good guy!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,George,,"@Kenji, bravery is not the word I would use; it is simply a matter of perspective. If you choose to see my stability as suspicious, that is your right, but remember that panic is the wolf's greatest ally.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you're so fancy even when you're being accused! But @Kenji, look! George is just telling us not to panic, but he's not actually proving he's a good guy! My spy instincts are tingling! I think it's him!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
